```
D07 Windows Firewall turned off from the command line (T1562.004)
Sysmon event 1. Sigma version: detections/sigma/D07-windows-firewall-disabled.yml
```
index=botsv3 sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" "<EventID>1</EventID>" netsh
| rex "Name='CommandLine'>(?<cmd>[^<]+)"
| rex "Name='User'>(?<user>[^<]+)"
| where match(lower(cmd), "netsh(\.exe)?\"?\s+(advfirewall\s+set\s+\S+\s+state\s+off|firewall\s+set\s+opmode\s+(mode=)?disable)")
| stats min(_time) as first_alert count values(cmd) as commands by host user
| eval first_alert=strftime(first_alert, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")
